#: ../../source/concepts.rst:4
msgid "Core concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page is the map of fl-sim: the four building blocks of every "
"experiment and what happens during one round of federated training. It "
"explains *how the framework thinks* — for a hands-on walk-through, start "
"with :doc:`quickstart`."
msgstr ""
"本页面是 fl-sim 的地图：每次实验的四个构件，以及一轮联邦训练中发生的事。它解释的是"
"框架的*思考方式*——若想先动手体验，请从 :doc:`quickstart` 开始。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:12
msgid "Four building blocks"
msgstr "四个构件"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:15
msgid "FedDataset — the data and how it is split"
msgstr "FedDataset——数据及其划分方式"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:17
msgid ""
"A :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset` bundles a raw "
"dataset with a **partitioning scheme**: it decides how the data is spread"
" across the simulated clients and hands each client its own dataloaders "
"through ``get_dataloader(client_idx)``. Built-in datasets (FEMNIST, "
"CIFAR10, …) download on first use; "
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic` generates "
"synthetic data locally, which is why every tutorial here runs in seconds."
" Each dataset also declares ``candidate_models`` — the models it is meant"
" to be paired with (``dataset.candidate_models[\"mlp_d1\"]``, as in the "
"quickstart). Datasets are **immutable during training**: partitioning "
"happens once, up front. Custom datasets are covered in a how-to guide."
msgstr ""
":class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_dataset.FedDataset` 把原始数据集与 **划分方案** "
"打包在一起：它决定数据如何在模拟的客户端之间分布，并通过 ``get_dataloader(client_idx)`` "
"为每个客户端提供专属的 dataloader。内置数据集（FEMNIST、CIFAR10 等）在首次使用时下载；"
" :class:`~fl_sim.data_processing.fed_synthetic.FedSynthetic` 在本地生成合成数据，"
"这也是本教程都能在几秒内跑完的原因。每个数据集还声明了 ``candidate_models``——"
"适合与它搭配的模型（如 quickstart 中的 ``dataset.candidate_models[\"mlp_d1\"]``）。"
"数据集在 **训练期间不可变** ：划分只做一次，且在训练开始前完成。自定义数据集见相应的"
" how-to 指南。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:29
msgid "Model — a plain PyTorch module"
msgstr "模型——普通的 PyTorch 模块"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:31
msgid ""
"Models are ordinary :class:`torch.nn.Module` objects; fl-sim does not "
"wrap them. Whatever ``candidate_models`` offers or you bring yourself "
"works. The server holds the *global* copy; every sampled client gets its "
"own copy each round, trains it on its local data slice, and sends the "
"result back."
msgstr ""
"模型就是普通的 :class:`torch.nn.Module` 对象，fl-sim 不做任何包装。"
"``candidate_models`` 提供的或你自己带来的模型都可以用。服务器持有 *全局* 副本；"
"每轮每个被采样的客户端拿到自己的副本，在本地数据切片上训练，再把结果发回。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:38
msgid "Server — the orchestrator"
msgstr "服务器——调度者"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:40
msgid ""
"The :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server` owns the global model and the federated"
" schedule (how many rounds, how many clients, how they are sampled), and "
"drives the loop you will see below. It never touches client-local data. "
"Algorithm-specific behavior lives in subclasses: "
":class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvgServer`, "
":class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedprox.FedProxServer`, and 15+ others — each "
"customizes a handful of well-defined hooks:"
msgstr ""
":class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server` 持有全局模型与联邦调度（多少轮、多少客户端、如何采样），"
"并驱动下文所示的循环。它从不触碰客户端本地数据。算法特定的行为都在子类里："
":class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvgServer`、"
":class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedprox.FedProxServer` 等 15 个以上——每个算法只定制"
"少数几个定义良好的钩子："

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:48
msgid ""
"``communicate(target)`` — the **downlink**: what the server sends to a "
"sampled client (typically the current global model);"
msgstr ""
"``communicate(target)``——**下行**：服务器发给被采样客户端的内容（通常是当前全局模型）；"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:50
msgid ""
"``update()`` — the **aggregation**: how client replies are turned into "
"the new global model."
msgstr "``update()``——**聚合**：客户端回复如何变成新的全局模型。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:54
msgid "Client — one participant's local state"
msgstr "客户端——单个参与方的本地状态"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:56
msgid ""
"Each :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Client` holds its own model copy, its data "
"slice, and its training state. Its hooks are the mirror image of the "
"server's:"
msgstr ""
"每个 :class:`~fl_sim.nodes.Client` 持有自己的模型副本、数据切片与训练状态。"
"它的钩子与服务器互为镜像："

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:60
msgid ""
"``update()`` — the **local training**: fit the received model on local "
"data (local epochs, local optimizer — all from the client config);"
msgstr ""
"``update()``——**本地训练**：在本地数据上拟合收到的模型（本地 epoch 数、本地优化器"
"——全部来自客户端配置）；"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:62
msgid ""
"``communicate()`` — the **uplink**: build the message sent back to the "
"server. Messages are typed objects "
"(:class:`~fl_sim.messages.ClientToServer`) carrying the updated model "
"state plus algorithm-specific extras."
msgstr ""
"``communicate()``——**上行**：构建发回服务器的消息。消息是带类型的对象"
"（:class:`~fl_sim.messages.ClientToServer`），携带更新后的模型状态与算法特有的附加内容。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:67
msgid "Algorithms customize the hooks, not the loop"
msgstr "算法定制钩子，而不是循环"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:69
msgid ""
"fl-sim ships 20 registered algorithms — FedAvg, FedProx, SCAFFOLD, FedPD,"
" ProxSkip, Ditto, … — and they all run in the *same* loop. An algorithm "
"is only a pair of config classes plus hook overrides: FedProx changes the"
" client's local objective; SCAFFOLD adds control variates to the uplink; "
"FedPD lets clients *skip* some uplinks entirely. The framework calls the "
"hooks in a fixed order (below), so algorithms compose with the "
"infrastructure — logging, evaluation, reproducibility, parallel execution"
" — without any of them knowing about each other."
msgstr ""
"fl-sim 内置 20 个注册算法——FedAvg、FedProx、SCAFFOLD、FedPD、ProxSkip、Ditto 等——"
"它们全部运行在*同一个*循环里。一个算法只是一对配置类加上若干钩子覆写：FedProx 改动"
"客户端的本地目标函数；SCAFFOLD 在上行里加入控制变量；FedPD 允许客户端*完全跳过*某些"
"上行。框架按固定顺序（见下）调用这些钩子，因此算法与基础设施——日志、评估、可复现性、"
"并行执行——正交组合，互不知晓。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:78
msgid ""
"Registering your own makes it usable from the CLI and experiment matrices"
" by name:"
msgstr "注册自己的算法后，就能在 CLI 与实验矩阵中按名字使用它："

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:91
msgid ""
"The how-to guide on custom algorithms walks through a complete, runnable "
"example; :doc:`parallel_execution` documents the hook contract that keeps"
" custom algorithms compatible with every executor."
msgstr ""
"自定义算法的 how-to 指南给出了完整可运行的例子；:doc:`parallel_execution` 记录了"
"钩子契约，保证自定义算法与所有执行后端兼容。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:96
msgid "One round of training"
msgstr "一轮训练"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:98
msgid ""
"``server.train()`` runs ``num_iters`` rounds. Every round proceeds in a "
"fixed order:"
msgstr "``server.train()`` 运行 ``num_iters`` 轮。每轮按固定顺序进行："

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Sampling** — the server picks this round's participants (the "
"``clients_sample_ratio`` fraction of ``num_clients``)."
msgstr ""
"**采样**——服务器选出本轮的参与方（``num_clients`` 中按 ``clients_sample_ratio`` "
"比例抽取）。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Uplink decision** — per algorithm: most algorithms have every sampled "
"client respond; communication-skipping algorithms (FedPD, ProxSkip) "
"decide *now*, on the main thread, which clients will upload this round."
msgstr ""
"**上行决策**——因算法而异：多数算法让每个被采样客户端都响应；通信跳过型算法"
"（FedPD、ProxSkip）在 *此刻* 于主线程上决定哪些客户端本轮上传。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:107
msgid ""
"**Downlink broadcast** — the server sends the global model to each "
"sampled client (``server.communicate(target)``)."
msgstr ""
"**下行广播**——服务器把全局模型发给每个被采样客户端（``server.communicate(target)``）。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Local steps** — each selected client runs evaluate → local training → "
"build the uplink message. Clients never see each other or the global "
"state; they touch only their own slice."
msgstr ""
"**本地步**——每个被选中的客户端依次执行评估 → 本地训练 → 构建上行消息。"
"客户端之间互不可见，也看不到全局状态；它们只触碰自己的数据切片。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Uplink + aggregation** — replies are consumed **in sampled-client "
"order** and the algorithm's ``update()`` produces the new global model. "
"Metrics (server-side and per-client) are logged here."
msgstr ""
"**上行与聚合**——回复 **按被采样客户端的顺序** 被消费，算法的 ``update()`` 产出新的"
"全局模型。指标（服务器侧与每个客户端的）也在这里记录。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:115
msgid ""
"**Repeat** — for ``num_iters`` rounds; logs and metrics land in "
"``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/`` (see :doc:`quickstart`)."
msgstr ""
"**重复**——共 ``num_iters`` 轮；日志与指标写入 ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/`` "
"（参见 :doc:`quickstart`）。"

#: ../../source/concepts.rst:118
msgid ""
"Because steps 1–2 and 5 happen on the main thread in fixed order, the "
"*aggregation arithmetic* is identical no matter how the local steps of "
"step 4 are executed — sequentially, or concurrently on a thread pool "
"(:doc:`parallel_execution`). That invariant is what makes parallel runs "
"trustworthy."
msgstr ""
"由于第 1–2 步与第 5 步在主线程上按固定顺序执行，无论第 4 步的本地步是串行执行还是"
"在线程池上并发执行（:doc:`parallel_execution`）， *聚合算术* 都完全一致。"
"正是这条不变式让并行运行值得信赖。"

